The NaFlex image preprocessing in runtime/naflex_preprocess.cpp ports code from three
upstream sources.

1. The patch-budget size search and the patch layout follow
   get_image_size_for_max_num_patches and convert_image_to_patches in
   src/transformers/models/siglip2/image_processing_siglip2.py of transformers v5.2.0:
   https://github.com/huggingface/transformers/blob/v5.2.0/src/transformers/models/siglip2/image_processing_siglip2.py
