   ImagingResampleHorizontal_8bpc, ImagingResampleVertical_8bpc and the pass order of
   ImagingResampleInner in src/libImaging/Resample.c of Pillow 13.0.0:
   https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/blob/13.0.0/src/libImaging/Resample.c
